            word, age, lag, arabic_s = '', 99, 99, False
    carry = (doc, word, (recent + text)[-200:], age, lag + 1, arabic_s)
    return carry, float(value)

"""Detect single horizontal-whitespace tokens continuing a whitespace run.

A lone space following spaces is the main response, especially early in
a document. Long preceding space tokens weaken it. Tabs and nonbreaking
spaces have smaller responses. Bundled whitespace and ordinary text are
left at zero. Document-initial whitespace has separate starting values.
