"""Letter-d detector: fires on the letter d (Latin, or its look-alikes
Cyrillic д, Greek δ, Arabic د) when it appears inside the current token.
Strongest for a bare 'd' and for short fragments that contain d (bed, id, cd);
weaker for longer words; boosted when the fragment is glued onto a preceding
letter (a word split across tokens)."""

